msgstr "タグからバージョンを抽出（例: `v1.2.3` → `1.2.3`）"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:68
msgid "Validate Gradle wrapper"
msgstr "Gradle Wrapper の検証"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:69
msgid ""
"Run pre-release checks: `ktlintCheck test verifyPluginStructure "
"verifyPlugin`"
msgstr ""
"リリース前チェックの実行: `ktlintCheck test verifyPluginStructure "
"verifyPlugin`"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:70
msgid "Build plugin"
msgstr "プラグインのビルド"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:71
msgid "Create GitHub Release with auto-generated release notes"
msgstr "自動生成されたリリースノートで GitHub Release を作成"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:72
msgid "Attach plugin ZIP as release asset"
msgstr "プラグイン ZIP をリリースアセットとして添付"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:73
msgid ""
"Pre-release detection: tags containing `-` (e.g., `v1.0.0-beta.1`) are "
"marked as pre-release"
msgstr ""
"プレリリースの検出: `-` を含むタグ（例: `v1.0.0-beta.1`）はプレリリースとしてマーク"
"されます"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:75
msgid "Creating a release"
msgstr "リリースの作成"

#: ../../dev/ci-cd.md:88
msgid ""
"JetBrains Marketplace publishing is not yet automated. See the TODO in "
